The comment in the gi'uste says "[also x4 post office, mailbox]", and
says that one way that {mrilu} differs from {benji} is that in the
latter, "the medium need not be a 3rd party service/system".

In which case, for samymri, the place corresponding to x4 of mrilu
would presumably be the mail server - the drop-off point for the mail
system used by the selmri.

